+| AD-2 | **Manual page routing preserved.** `st.session_state.page` continues as the routing mechanism. | Architecture Review §8-2 |
+| AD-3 | **Batman DD pages imported as modules.** No file relocation. | Architecture Review §8-3 |
+| AD-4 | **Batman DD app entry point deprecated.** `src/batman_dd/app.py` not deleted but unused. | Architecture Review §8-4 |
+| AD-5 | **"My Plan & Progress" renamed to "Progress".** Internal navigation replaces external link. | Architecture Review §8-5 |
+| AD-6 | **Pre-existing session keys unchanged.** New keys follow the same convention. | Architecture Review §8-6 |
+| AD-7 | **Visual Shell Consistency.** DRONA shell consistent across workspaces; workspace-specific components may retain their own styling. Full CSS consolidation deferred. | Architecture Review §8-7 |
